      "message": "fix(cargo-cost-lint): wire up .lintignore filtering and fix compile errors\n\n- Fix missing Path import and unhandled Option<String> config path\n- Actually use the .lintignore/.gitignore walker to filter lint findings,\n  instead of building it and discarding it\n- Route both --format text and --format json through the same JSON-based\n  filtering path so .lintignore works in both modes\n- Add unit tests for allowed_files() and is_reportable()\n\nCloses #57",
